### 5. Chained Workflow (7 Steps)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Persistent Conversation History         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                         │
│ STEP 1: Define Research Topic & Scope  │
│ → Agent reads topic from file (filesystem MCP)
│                                         │
│ STEP 2: Gather Insights From Web       │
│ → Agent fetches 6-8 sources (fetch MCP)
│ → Observations extracted with quotes + URLs
│                                         │
│ STEP 3: Analyze & Extract Observations│
│ → 20-40 atomic observations            │
│ → Each tied to quote, source, sentiment
│                                         │
│ STEP 4: Cluster Into Themes            │
│ → 3-5 ranked themes (frequency × severity)
│                                         │
│ STEP 5: Synthesize (Invoke Skill)      │
│ → Agent calls: "I'm using ux-research Skill"
│ → Builds personas, problem statements  │
│ → Synthesizes testable hypotheses      │
│                                         │
│ STEP 6: Validation Loop (CHECK → REVISE)
│ → Grade against 10-point rubric        │
│ → If FAIL: auto-revise (max 2 cycles) │
│ → If PASS: proceed                     │
│                                         │
│ STEP 7: Finalize & Output              │
│ → Write 8 files (filesystem MCP):      │
│   - research_findings_report.md        │
│   - raw_observations.json              │
│   - themes_ranked.json                 │
│   - behavioral_personas.json           │
│   - problem_statements.json            │
│   - user_goals_decisions.json          │
│   - curated_quotes.json                │
│   - hypotheses_with_recommendations.json
│                                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Key:** Full context maintained across all 7 steps. Skill invoked in STEP 5. Both MCP servers used.

