## How to Run

```bash
# Setup (one time)
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env, add: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxx

# Run workflow
python agent.py

# Expected output: 8 files in output/ folder
ls -la output/
```

**Timeline:** 5–15 minutes. Agent runs all 7 steps, maintains context, invokes Skill, validates quality.

